[?2004l[?2004h> """Keyset ("seek") pagination for order listings.
[?2004l[?2004h> +
[?2004l[?2004h> +The service switched from ``LIMIT/OFFSET`` to keyset pagination in 2025 (see
[?2004l[?2004h> +PERF-87).  A keyset page starts right after the last row the client has seen,
