[?2004l[?2004h> +Previously the cursor only stored ``created_at``.  When multiple orders share the same timestamp (common because timestamps are second‑resolution) the next page used ``created_at < ?`` and inadvertently skipped the remaining rows with that timestamp.  This caused missing orders during exports and API walks.
